">Armed mine (possible target is nearby)</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ProxExplosiveRed.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Armed mine (the target is close)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/ProxExplosiveRed.png/150px-ProxExplosiveRed.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/ProxExplosiveRed.png/225px-ProxExplosiveRed.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/ProxExplosiveRed.png/300px-ProxExplosiveRed.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Armed mine (the target is close)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/ProxExplosiveRed.png/150px-ProxExplosiveRed.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/ProxExplosiveRed.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Armed mine (the target is close)</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205646\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1265/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9060/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1927/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2968/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 730240/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.568      1 -total\n 51.55%   15.241      4 Template:Icon_text\n 49.01%   14.493     20 Template:Trim\n 43.84%   12.964      3 Template:Icon_link\n 35.17%   10.398      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 34.00%   10.052      1 Template:Quest\n 31.37%    9.276      6 Template:Ifempty\n 28.16%    8.325      1 Template:Item_icon\n 11